Moth.Tasks", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "a64079c5c1db11c11125964d5db71960a33033fa", "message": "Smaller refactoring", "created_at": "2022-12-26T16:24:21Z", "repo": "Moth.Tasks", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "86c1e88ea27414c2248e2078e0f1ef7950c41c73", "message": "Fixed duplicate header in TaskFromExtensions. Fixed some incorrect exception documentation", "created_at": "2022-11-29T16:32:11Z", "repo": "Moth.Tasks", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "4539f34de4ae88a2d6e2de0c3b2d187ae31dd283", "message": "Implemented Seperate TaskDataStore to pave way for multiple types of taskqueues.", "created_at": "2022-11-29T12:47:54Z", "repo": "Moth.Tasks", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "011d8b8787c656dcbfc6f84732baff08cb3a0534", "message": "Added Insert of references in TaskReferenceStore.", "created_at": "2022-09-19T08:52:12Z", "repo": "Moth.Tasks", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "9ff3a81099123df47eb2c0b6368f6d1ac0044e1a", "message": "Moving task data into seperate class TaskDataStore", "created_at": "2022-09-11T10:50:48Z", "repo": "Moth.Tasks", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "b4032529c5bdcf9edeafee08f7f0ea34b1f88b0c", "message": "Added Task helper class.\n\nContains Enqueue extension method for ITasks as an alternative to TaskQueue.Enqueue.\n\nContains Then extension method for ITasks which when given a second ITask returns a ChainedTasks which executes the second task after the first.", "created_at": "2022-09-09T09:19:22Z", "repo": "Moth.Tasks", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "b2f712ce3594b305bbd6d4d92cd9631e41db8575", "message": "Merge pull request #8 from djmoth/task-data\n\nChanged how TaskQueue stores task data.\r\n\r\nBeforehand, tasks were stored in an object array, where tasks where written directly to the array, as object references inside the task struct would be stored in an index in the array. Data which were not references would also be stored as object references, leading to crashes during GC in Unity.\r\n\r\nThe new system uses Moth.IO.Serialization to serialize and deserialize task data, both compressing the data by removing padding, and stripping references and stores them safely in a Queue<object>, where they are enqueued and dequeued in the order they appear in the struct data layout.", "created_at": "2022-08-24T13:32:41Z", "repo": "Moth.Tasks", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "ae2e1cca8f67c1947f3c878f5697fc025829c7b8", "message": "Added task serialization through Moth.IO.Serialization", "created_at": "2022-08-24T13:26:27Z", "repo": "Moth.Tasks", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "1e2f9fe0d4726ecf34081a7f196ceab388337fc8", "message": "Merge pull request #7 from djmoth/worker-join\n\nImplemented Join methods on Worker & WorkerGroup", "created_at": "2022-06-27T16:50:14Z", "repo": "Moth.Tasks", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "77de372ed0340be70bb8a5ca1248dcf2e0639d7b", "message": "Add Join methods to Worker and WorkerGroup", "created_at": "2022-06-27T14:18:34Z", "repo": "Moth.Tasks", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "a5504774fc5f785b27cbd16ef2fc46d70a052858", "message": "Begun work on TaskSerializer which can generate methods for serializing a task.", "created_at": "2022-05-19T11:01:01Z", "repo": "Moth.Tasks", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "b2ae791bd0af65719805706bc2b838b4f457260a", "message": "Prepared to add generation of task serialization methods.", "created_at": "2022-05-09T06:29:53Z", "repo": "Moth.Tasks", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file":